    "detailed_description": "This game was developed by one person so it has many flaws, please point out the flaws and /or downsides, I'll try my best to improve the game design and make it more fun.<br>Special thanks to Abdullah Konash who created and shared Arabic Support For Unity plugin.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Description</h2><br>Busy Bee is a relaxing game to get rid of daily stress. Play as a bee and build cells, guard home, collect nectar, do whatever you can to survive the winter.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Cute bees graphics reduce the fear of insects.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>7 player co-op game.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>4+2 unique classes and skills.</li></ul><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2375090/extras/874f86270f95f5152f895c95fd7e1f04.avif?t=1729226223\" /></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>More than one way to get food and survive the winter, <br>explore and discover different ways.</li></ul><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2375090/extras/66684fc4e420ed0eda0ee63cb90f4635.poster.avif?t=1729226223\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2375090/extras/66684fc4e420ed0eda0ee63cb90f4635.webm?t=1729226223\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2375090/extras/66684fc4e420ed0eda0ee63cb90f4635.mp4?t=1729226223\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2375090/extras/0ea9230250381a779f1767d475e93d83.poster.avif?t=1729226223\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2375090/extras/0ea